  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>p</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>For rational roots,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math>&nbsp;must be a perfect square.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now put values in reverse order as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;the maximum value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo><mtext>not&#160;a&#160;perfect&#160;square</mtext></math></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo><mtext>perfect&#160;square</mtext></math></p><p>So, the maximum integral value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/37c1b0b7-0d80-4db8-9f2a-2fcb835972f4-9896074.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 345px;\" /></p><p>Area of shaded region&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>9</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>9</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>243</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mtext>unit</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>",
